          </div>
          <h3>4 GB file uploads</h3>
          <p>Upload and share files of up to 4 GB instead of the standard 2 GB</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card fade-in">
          <div class="benefit-icon bi-speed">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none"><path d="M15 5L7 16h6l-2 7 8-11h-6l2-7z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Faster downloads</h3>
          <p>Download media and files at maximum speed with no throttling</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card fade-in">
          <div class="benefit-icon bi-noads">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none"><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M7 21L21 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>No ads in channels</h3>
          <p>Sponsored messages in public channels disappear entirely</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card fade-in">
          <div class="benefit-icon bi-sticker">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none"><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M10 16c1.5 2 5.5 2 7 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="10.5" cy="12" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="12" r="1.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Exclusive stickers and reactions</h3>
          <p>Premium-only animated stickers, custom emoji and extra reactions</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card fade-in">
          <div class="benefit-icon bi-profile">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none"><circle cx="14" cy="11" r="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M6 24c0-4.4 3.6-8 8-8s8 3.6 8 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Premium profile</h3>
          <p>A verified-style badge, animated profile video and a longer bio</p>
        </div>
        <div class="benefit-card fade-in">
          <div class="benefit-icon bi-translate">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none"><path d="M4 7h12M10 4v3M7 7c0 4 3 8 7 10M15 7c0 4-3 8-7 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M16 18l3-6 3 6M17 16h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Real-time translation</h3>
          <p>Translate whole chats into your language with a single tap</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How to buy -->
  <section class="prem-how">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header fade-in">
        <span class="section-label">How it works</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">How to buy Telegram Premium</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Three steps inside the bot</p>
      </div>
      <div class="how-steps">
        <div class="how-step fade-in">
          <div class="how-step-num">1</div>
          <h3>Open the bot</h3>
          <p>Open <strong>@starsjoybot</strong> in Telegram and choose "Premium"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step fade-in">
          <div class="how-step-num">2</div>
          <h3>Pick a plan</h3>
          <p>Choose 3, 6 or 12 months and enter the Telegram username it is for</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-step fade-in">
          <div class="how-step-num">3</div>
          <h3>Pay and receive</h3>
          <p>Transfer the exact amount from Click, Payme or your bank app — Premium activates in about 10 seconds</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="how-cta fade-in">
        <a href="https://telegram.me/starsjoybot" class="btn-primary" target="_blank">&#9889; Start now</a>
        <p class="how-guide-note"><a href="/en/how-to-buy">See every step with screenshots &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Trust -->
  <section class="prem-trust">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header fade-in">
        <span class="section-label">Trust</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Why buy through StarsJoy</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">What we do to protect your money and your account</p>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-grid">
        <div class="trust-item fade-in">
          <span class="trust-num">8,000+</span>
          <h3>Completed orders</h3>
          <p>The service has been running for over a year and the order count is published openly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item fade-in">
          <span class="trust-num">~10 s</span>
          <h3>Delivery time</h3>
          <p>Once payment is confirmed the subscription usually reaches the account in about 10 seconds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item fade-in">
          <span class="trust-num">100%</span>
          <h3>Refund</h3>
          <p>If the service is not delivered or something goes wrong, you get the full amount back.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item fade-in">
          <span class="trust-num">5%</span>
          <h3>Referral bonus</h3>
          <p>When somebody buys through your personal link, 5% of the amount comes back to you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="trust-note fade-in">
        Customer reviews are moderated but never edited or deleted, and each one carries a date — you can
        read them in full on the <a href="/sharhlar">reviews page</a> (in Uzbek). StarsJoy is not an
        official Telegram partner: under clause 2.3 of its <a href="/oferta">public offer</a> it operates
        as an independent reseller delivering through Telegram's official API and the Fragment
        infrastructure, so the subscription is attached to your real account through the official route.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="prem-faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header fade-in">
        <span class="section-label">FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently asked questions</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Telegram Premium in Uzbekistan — the questions people actually ask</p>
